{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1293,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:579974d2699c3deca3f9496c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶！我的卖点明明是\r\n豪迈的气势，为什么会\r\n这么提不起劲……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec968ce16e510baac1847abbc5dce17d27bb2458b881834ec213e0f55099434d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8050eb2d67aa2de0eda4e183",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我去洗把脸。\r\n至少要重新鼓起干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e31467a8159d2349e20161e989aef40687a3684b8c0f709985e18b9205e82ab6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e96712d1d7ce14c71b8ea306",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果只跟平常一样就太无趣了……\r\n再怎么说，至少要展现出气魄！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5dfec4f5387cdb3aef0032f3b90301a67cf9f769b9cd64687e36eabdc03d1d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d38c4588d0535c2bc5e8668",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得状态不太好，\r\n但这样才更要享受比赛，\r\n不然有损江户之子的名声！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d0bb5eba8daf467752f4193588b39fcb43923377c8e5eebeb635c8b951f7cb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bde035dc05bfe7ca30d398cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使提不起劲，\r\n江户之子依然不会跑也不会躲，\r\n只会与人正面对决！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fc0ad55094e02884b683441f5b4ca35e5f1ae08490e1861d1e978c7374553d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9cc3a62188b2f3a95351bca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "156457bc54ba27ebeaab1aba3aaf9a68ceea61cd9f05dfb3deffdb2be3ad073e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af5ece133840fbe781644ef3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb5b5f74ef2384c6c0a89d001ced307776a3b463e8ad6c297c9c98980420a95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5c57797d2344ba07f91fd3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f043c92a73ea01d9a6c9583b05ffc9795fcce7ae0ffdb2a100e73fc8ad95f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0419b1b8814ce0705ca101c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "知道了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9afeecaf9d8d2dc191e807f43cf94ef42f53160a8fbd7b6874467cebcd375a68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd18c39a6d1b26531a8b1874",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不妙！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c84f5d36abaa358a8ba8a147c99c6e9350100bffc189a6160e7be9d798437491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a37450adfb2623ff4dbcb24c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "搞什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5ba6ea93f75d25a1f08c590b48e926c6937a72ff722b5ae0d06c620e29a66f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32861292f18f27b1d03f90e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要出动啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73b93d8757810d5114a0ab5597ea3c5582b22c0999d8be09ad6e68695cd3dacd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60ca2535f227f3f729b1ea06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀喝──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "914260824057965c08d7f825ac301cd49d40bacf747b5e195a039d2f5da40974",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d30bf187d0c65ddda76f01b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说出来就不潇洒了……不过谢谢你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f92fb1d4672b87ab3bd77948f6ccfa911962b66789f364f28af9ac3343beb7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fcd8296ab51c47677492447",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很庆幸我的搭档是你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c86d920b17c9923247bbca73e7859f15527f7b35e0c16199ac68aa035a19915",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98552e16c0665881c41c86f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来跑一趟吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6001a9f46904bac5848e21751e5dfc850ef3bb580dbf096deffb63ef47874d02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fd9526e5d3ec744531e680b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上场了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "092de8b679dc1d62be9d0345f00b41ce5d39669391cc434ea8f1c32929be88df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6769f12ed9b8376b91737c3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，要上啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b123d718a3a2e29402c75bbaa91ea7a4d9cd9e8c9a1e1148f7bd9d637bcf53b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dd00ecdae3cf2ab187fae08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很庆幸我的搭档是你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c86d920b17c9923247bbca73e7859f15527f7b35e0c16199ac68aa035a19915",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:277834fede4303aed8ea5dd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热闹的祭典要开始了！\r\n主角当然是……我本人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "956e3385d7477cb58847315500b518f406045221d0dc579dc4bc9c7cd850c32b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a2cbc377edeba08c6b6fca5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你尽管放心，\r\n把一切都交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7595e813b3c5aaf09341cd443114fb4a82500c8b4ee867c3ce2d020c68e437cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b14a7eadf9812e9fea8d07a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很庆幸我的搭档是你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c86d920b17c9923247bbca73e7859f15527f7b35e0c16199ac68aa035a19915",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31f0df5e6db601a2e331ae95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やるぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05bfb0caef818adc10910869c0499d0fa23c598e18b2555e93f48f643306a300",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5ec7dd297b0acb0a1b89baf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，对手也很行呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "687958c9f4dd447bbbf0a334131a4310ca7643b3412187d5ff60a1da5511dc32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb6ae71474da58bebdcb35d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～！输了热血对决还是会不甘心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e0cc655fb2718f1d0858848752a272c554d662c05aeee617bc08febc41865b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d0c1950290509129c9c5753",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是个不上不下的结果……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6f5a797a296285da6806682154eced1578eac6b798c6c94301233538fc34692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:459ce085e892359881a8804d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶，我真是太不中用了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8ecbc69c128cd53c7c0245dbc24b8d378836ac4513a2b7659c97fa700c55810",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1450afa36fb267450625cf19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用背影传达一切才潇洒！\r\n这就是稻荷大人的风格！",
      "source_fingerprint": "007de1a9afef22202e940365cc22fc02ce07b067e61f134cbda33055e3f96b2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43c72c8afb8e0e73524d5242",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样！就是这么简单啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e482bcca3d70cbabb06c83465c7bd455c749ea04cb0be08c95d58b5abb63c438",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:850d8868e7bda36f37ca21e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "此刻我们的奔驰\r\n将连结起永恒的意念！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c087bbe323d45f233e5cc079baa0787fd4ed2b7450598f6703669174ff48ea2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6630dba183c399882f2e8d86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样！就是这么简单啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e482bcca3d70cbabb06c83465c7bd455c749ea04cb0be08c95d58b5abb63c438",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63ab1ce3fd22d3596d4385c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去大闹一场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66c94b490f0c572ff96f3f5dd400506ac58f546519f1ee6fa47b2fb42e7fc201",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52ce8799f53a28a60436951d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，好好看仔细了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4662601e0428d7538d98d6dfc0b469ec8e5810f9390810f33164dfb7d2793ee7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df9f008ed28f9bc0621ac6d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，开始热血沸腾了！\r\n就由我们来让「神马驱」的气氛\r\n炒热到极点吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b154d8988ec17cf6fc313fa4fdd645eb293632120f038543e8adcd0a2d5e4ed0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddcc3f388f10b4016788c0f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小玉明明那么会照顾人\r\n却完全没有自觉呢。\r\n或许这点正显示了她的大将之风吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "326bfffc736edbd1ec9e11101534ce69a82ac2b2065fc88332cf1a1d329534dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:565c4d4d859f0ac18687bbf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一同用餐、一同入浴，正因我们\r\n彼此团结才能达成今日这番光景。\r\n接下来让我们大展身手吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "130da4e6f731f5536ff5ceecf040d85b7cdabd88160d0e74391e389e9a89b70f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7190da43585bc61aca57db8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看仔细了，亮眼的江户豪迈姑娘！\r\n稻荷大人要开始发威了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31d00766360fbf4b075eec2763037f4c8da0bff3cc95786672cf046c0ffdb941",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b178301e1b7a4bba50ef4c78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吾等心愿啊，奔驰吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "507f23809dd659123498cd148c7103838ae997009f6f5a647af7fcc1ee776350",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d7ad37c947db5819c67fb3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "串连着过去与未来的「此刻」！\r\n超越时间与空间，\r\n吾等心愿啊，奔驰吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfeb82039dd4ce80bc9acababfb9950bcd36801ecc25c3999d3e1cf9a0ec343a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30743c9650892f829fd81c3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "期待已久的重大时刻！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64baf33471b31438fc9021d58a2593389f52a84c63c60b21b9bf9ca1a47eebe5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e074297931d4218d8873033",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祭典开始了！打起精神来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b059d45140aba9331d36f36f7e627bcf8aa00c082a81e96f058a1d0d3216a30d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c086a8a9a7597b86d591415a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "潇洒地跑一场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "409b883f2a9392f86d1bdbf15133a8cd7969e25b8d4c8bf1051e6cf9f3d180ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18cd3a2ebc02639fe6665374",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仔细想想，我和你也是在\r\n机缘巧合之下认识的。\r\n人与人的缘分真是不可思议呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44d0ff5ec0d08fe66f347c4dd8b667c69a3aec87176315407ccc8a64f4531a52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1371c5c6240ebe43d72d5664",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样，我穿制服也很潇洒吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "96eff0cead4035082f18d86d0874d504258c52a2d0792eebd6d3e1cd653e5062",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40f0da3b35e2da1687d6ec4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "演唱会就是祭典吧！\r\n穿上这件衣服就觉得很兴奋呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcd12edbaa156df583aa6d319b9ce9c0709a5ab025bd43dfbdf09f21863664fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79dc929cc1c3c8955d895c76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿嘿，是件很有江户之子的风格，\r\n豪迈又亮眼的服装呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2079d5c54a380ee11cc8602e1af39a3795398640160b8a70face0f4a992ad2ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70faecb006bda5fc99cc3917",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所有穿这件衣服的人，\r\n都像是住同一间大杂院的伙伴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea6c50cc1b3582104d9051d065ed0da3ab9be4bc775d7214047f04aa0ef72766",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b664ad0799f73cc92f2bca8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再来只要放个祭典音乐，\r\n身体就会自己跳起舞来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c002713a1dddbe9fd023bbbeddcb015dd74be129edd1040be470b221831063d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20b0d06edc6da2b5e27499c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上后就能深刻地体会到。\r\n专家的技术实在令人敬佩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60c999b85ca9355bbcc98d9c90f7bbe21f47549354a3c9b2fab945da70606f68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3529c37735a6a78b68c443aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "围过来围过来！\r\n稻荷大人登场啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e7712fed798e19db73bcd18d98d1f9472fe1f0604e540887e6fca64c30f3b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0083222748cae383abc3166",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如何？\r\n看起来很神圣吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a31f25664d84dbe042d23b96d37ffc6bd4870177d808d50276e9112b633b2901",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35940a477deb3df666840d71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管什么衣服，我都会穿得很潇洒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f60625aae1b3948c05040a3917c1962b5191efcdb082da789cb9d1b6e32339ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33f94377f8603c41bd45b8ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "江户之子除了装扮以外，\r\n举止也要够潇洒才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36e02c0d14caa1062ac597ecba1ec272667726fc0bcf6653d209be6417ea03ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88ac06f2129c5c30b80e0278",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出かけんのかい？どこでもついてくぜ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ebee64981c1a98cee5f4df0519c67d719157f8fe0426659e64b89c4249f8053",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15222e32d6a58c261910b428",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレセン学園は休みの日でも賑やかでいいねえ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18a25a7facf86969bba27c414f7cebca9078db863eece9ab7f9b29c35bf65114",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f2f54d8c9e1d6fe36a699db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样，我穿制服也很潇洒吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "96eff0cead4035082f18d86d0874d504258c52a2d0792eebd6d3e1cd653e5062",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afc8642c997f8e3a3bb9c66e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "演唱会就是祭典吧！\r\n穿上这件衣服就觉得很兴奋呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcd12edbaa156df583aa6d319b9ce9c0709a5ab025bd43dfbdf09f21863664fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13099e78c9e58b2a99f7c80e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿嘿，是件很有江户之子的风格，\r\n豪迈又亮眼的服装呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2079d5c54a380ee11cc8602e1af39a3795398640160b8a70face0f4a992ad2ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9be3777652a3092f30142892",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所有穿这件衣服的人，\r\n都像是住同一间大杂院的伙伴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea6c50cc1b3582104d9051d065ed0da3ab9be4bc775d7214047f04aa0ef72766",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31a8c1bb9c65cc03d74f774d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再来只要放个祭典音乐，\r\n身体就会自己跳起舞来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c002713a1dddbe9fd023bbbeddcb015dd74be129edd1040be470b221831063d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aec00098a890be2198748665",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上后就能深刻地体会到。\r\n专家的技术实在令人敬佩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60c999b85ca9355bbcc98d9c90f7bbe21f47549354a3c9b2fab945da70606f68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6987c1641e7792d826646a33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "围过来围过来！\r\n稻荷大人登场啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e7712fed798e19db73bcd18d98d1f9472fe1f0604e540887e6fca64c30f3b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e41397f40608f200838a7ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如何？\r\n看起来很神圣吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a31f25664d84dbe042d23b96d37ffc6bd4870177d808d50276e9112b633b2901",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ba649c33ad71a98007b2ffd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管什么衣服，我都会穿得很潇洒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f60625aae1b3948c05040a3917c1962b5191efcdb082da789cb9d1b6e32339ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c022e4f2871f308245dccae5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "江户之子除了装扮以外，\r\n举止也要够潇洒才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36e02c0d14caa1062ac597ecba1ec272667726fc0bcf6653d209be6417ea03ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8b1689eef58fa9b722e98aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5add90f28778e59ee4a20b21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ほほぉ、このあたしと勝負が\r\nしたいってか？気風のいい\r\nヤツが来たじゃねえか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d001c815a7bab37dfd016ec16e7d34f32b99478ccc78f1f2ab9c2bd7c30e5bc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9f49a2a71898e1b253bc1dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "相手が誰だろうと関係ねえ。\r\nやるってんなら、イナリ様は\r\nどどんと受けて立つだけよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e083e96a2b7e83d007a31074f468422ddc865f74fac9a30a8d904118db66010a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2592199552a6d50680d926e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，大哥！嘿嘿嘿，\r\n一大早就表现得睡眼惺忪，\r\n可是有损江户之子的名声！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09c1700eba7ce0ea068e507b6c7c7ee7c4f8c132513eea2cba167c95c23abdaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d579dde6763cd6f219a9e38b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白饭配味噌汤和纳豆，要是能再\r\n加个酱菜，就是完美的江户之子的\r\n早餐了。可以补充精力喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "971042c4807f3d4bfde8cc57af8970b50b1c5ddf923922abd2cfd65df4a1dc5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11daee7d7f0fe0dc318c73be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经到午餐时间啦。好好吃饭后，\r\n再继续加把劲吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d602dc95208d982d0e97454732143dbb47b18ba0f9a586dabf2c9130fd12c24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:104785749edffa393ee7d149",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不妙，居然打瞌睡了。\r\n啊～要是能悠闲地躺在榻榻米上\r\n睡午觉就太棒了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "93e4804bfed2777fc004c36a34ea9d4689611a56f48da9af11addcf1bd3695fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f021c2c0535d431904df298",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "洗澡水就是要够热才好。\r\n要是宿舍的洗澡水\r\n能再热一点就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35f5530ce55802e22221bc9b210ce6e62944e4597635f793c234a2a7e62ff53c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4313329853d10f92eb0cde36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天色已经彻底变暗了。\r\n晚上出去巡逻一下，\r\n提醒大家小心火烛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05219396ac98ac63f5ea9de81785a5e627eabda4d30102036c449f5cf6267df4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:886023ca4e69b1bdee8184a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是赏花或入学典礼，\r\n值得庆贺的场合就是要玩得尽兴。\r\n一起去大闹一场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82f37946dc93ffc13cb7f84b292fa03dff9e53cf6dd396615607ff37bd446295",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c0ef60e975cfc3d0bdb04a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到夏天当然就会想到祭典。\r\n没扛过神轿的夏天，\r\n实在太无趣了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fb7ebe8193c954f5cb9531dd85c6b337cd75c2d9fe59bc5bda35839ff6bb25c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49315b877c1b767729fe5906",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天的压轴就是酉之市！\r\n希望我们也能趁机求得一些福气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "581104a795b5a97f10d48f9c51121e1e4414d169ab5397d7e0d73332d4ac1ba6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f31b6e0aa7f61eeed8f4b253",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为天气冷就一直窝在家里\r\n实在太无聊了。懂得享受下雪的\r\n景色才是潇洒的江户之子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4616f4ccae67fa6b44ff04bde4e59de287c762b16814b96f10e7080609292e53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7858108e182b6ea8a3b66a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早啊！嘿嘿，看着日出\r\n就会想起「神马驱」集训时，\r\n那个美丽的太阳公公呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4bccbdd845271db6adffb8868c04c2a04ddb9344d85b97fa8db5db873494365",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:462f5402621e80b5b8c96395",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今天起得很早，\r\n所以稍微打扫了广场，\r\n又去向三女神像祈祷了一下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07b776028750b0794076b6109727fb4b0e531edb29dba84e157d7ab2af2c092f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "90011"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
